# Only pictures inside the linked folder are tracked. Whatever else it
# collects (.directory, Thumbs.db, .DS_Store, AppleDouble ._ files, sub-folders
# such as __MACOSX) stays out. A new picture still needs its own `git add`.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/Pictures/
/Pictures/*
!/Pictures/Desktop/
/Pictures/Desktop/*
!/Pictures/Desktop/Wallhaven/
/Pictures/Desktop/Wallhaven/*
!/Pictures/Desktop/Wallhaven/*.jpg
!/Pictures/Desktop/Wallhaven/*.jpeg
!/Pictures/Desktop/Wallhaven/*.png
!/Pictures/Desktop/Wallhaven/*.webp
!/Pictures/Desktop/Wallhaven/*.JPG
!/Pictures/Desktop/Wallhaven/*.JPEG
!/Pictures/Desktop/Wallhaven/*.PNG
!/Pictures/Desktop/Wallhaven/*.WEBP
/Pictures/Desktop/Wallhaven/._*
